  "bio": "Matt D Baum, an illustrative and fine line tattoo artist based at 3919 Knight St. in Vancouver, Canada, is renowned for their exceptional cleanliness. Clients commend the pristine condition of Matt's workspace and his adherence to rigorous sanitation protocols, ensuring a safe and hygienic experience for every tattoo session. His dedication to maintaining cleanliness not only speaks to his professionalism but also provides peace of mind to those who choose to get inked by him.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada"
